  "display_title": "Halloween Is Nothing Special",
  "description": "Halloween. It might be a special day for some, but at the same time, it might be a meaningless day for others. Jin-Yeong, who lost his boyfriend, Eun-Chan, 3 years ago, spends his Halloween in the least special way possible. No wait, he was trying to spend it that way. So why did the dead Eun-Chan suddenly appear next to him after all this time? \n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
